        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 6.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Umwami Uwiteka aravuga ati “Mbese sinarushaho guhana i Yerusalemu ubwo nzahateza ibihano byanjye bikomeye uko ari bine, ari byo inkota n'inzara, n'inyamaswa z'inkazi n'icyorezo, kugira ngo ngitsembemo abantu n'amatungo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko dore hazasigara abarokotse bazayisohorwamo, abahungu n'abakobwa. Dore bazabasanga, namwe muzabona ingeso zabo n'imirimo yabo, mushire agahinda k'ibibi byose nzaba nateye i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
